    "TXT_KEY_CIV_BROOD_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]It trains Giant Spiders at 60 hammers.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Hero: the Spider Queen.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_BROOD_PEDIA": "The Brood is the spider-kind of the deep forest, risen from its nests to take the woods for its own.",
